{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "82", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "So that is it from this game! We hope you enjoyed our coverage of this series. There a lot of matches being played on Monday so we hope you join us for those games. Till then, take care and goodbye!", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:42:05+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "81", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "West Indies skipper, Kieron Pollard says, he is pleased with how they pulled things back, it is a small ground and it is not easy to contain but they did well. He feels they are on track and doing well at the moment, they are showing good intensity but they need to keep going. Mentions Simmons is a joy to watch when he is in that mood, for a little man he can hit them really long but he needs to be consistent and always give us good starts. Further adds, the batting throughout has been very consistent, the bowling though has to be tight.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:40:47+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "80", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Ireland skipper, Andy Balbirnie, says they were under par, they were outclassed in all the departments today. States the manner of the dismissals were very soft and it is very disappointing, however, they can take positives from drawing a series against the Windies. Ends by saying there are a few players who impressed and he hopes the others can learn too.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:40:16+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Man of the Series, Kieron Pollard, says the team wanted him to do a job with the ball, you need to come out of your comfort zone and deliver and he did so. States they need to bowl better with the new ball, they can't let the teams get off to fliers which could be dangerous against better oppositions. Mentions he uses his experience in his bowling and that is why he is doing well. He hopes the younger guys can also learn from the experience.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:39:24+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "MAN OF THE MATCH, Lendl Simmons, says it was a good surface, after the rainfall, it was sliding onto the bat. States his role in this team is to go hard in the Powerplay and it is just about knowing your game now. Mentions he just wanted to go out and express himself, he did not get a score in the first game and he is happy with this performance. Ends by saying he is looking ahead for the T20 World Cup and they are preparing for that.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:29:18+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Credit though has to be given to the Windies bowlers! They were the one who set this victory up. They pulled things back outstandingly after O'Brien and Stirling got Ireland off to a flier. They did really well to pick up wickets at regular intervals and restrict Ireland to a below par score which they easily chased.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:27:03+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Chasing 139, one partnership is all you need and the Windies openers delivered. The two added 133 with Simmons being the mainstay and Lewis playing second fiddle. The latter fell 4 short of a half ton but Simmons stayed till the end and remained unbeaten 9 short of a ton. A destructive performance by him.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:25:47+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "That was some hitting! Brutal stuff from Simmons, just the 11 overs to chase 139. WOW! Yes, the target was always under-par but not many thought the Windies would do so quickly. Their players have rose to the occasion in this must-win game and ensured that they do not lose the series.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:24:33+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.6", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,339,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "67320", "Bowler_Name": "Simi Singh", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "SIX! Simmons ends it in style! He gets a gift to do so! A full toss on middle, Simmons pulls it well over the square leg fence. WEST INDIES WIN BY 9 WICKETS AND WITH 54 BALLS TO SPARE!", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:22:37+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.5", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "6,246,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "67320", "Bowler_Name": "Simi Singh", "Batsman": "63726", "Batsman_Name": "Nicholas Pooran", "Commentary": "Flatter and on middle, this is pushed down to long off for one.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:21:50+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Nicholas Pooran is the new man in with only 6 required.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:21:02+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.4", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "67320", "Bowler_Name": "Simi Singh", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "OUT! In the air... taken! Stop the press, the Irish have broken through! A little too late but something to rejoice for them. Lewis walks back 4 short of a half ton. A good innings from him, played second fiddle to Simmons but has done his job. Simi slows it up and lands it on middle, Lewis looks to play the slog sweep but gets a top edge. It goes high up in the air towards the leg side. Wilson calls for it and takes it.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "59314", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:20:49+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.3", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "7,276,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "67320", "Bowler_Name": "Simi Singh", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "FOUR! Just a maximum away! Shorter and on middle, it is hit hard down the ground towards the long on fence.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:19:44+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.2", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "7,279,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "67320", "Bowler_Name": "Simi Singh", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "SIX! 10 more needed now! Singh angles it into the batter, Lewis hits it high and handsome over the long on fence.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:19:15+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.1", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "67320", "Bowler_Name": "Simi Singh", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "On off, Lewis pushes it to covers.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:18:49+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Simi Singh is back on! This could well be the last over of the game, especially after looking at the way the two are smashing the ball.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:18:26+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,331,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63157", "Bowler_Name": "Barry McCarthy", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "SIX! Just the 16 more needed now! A short one around middle, Simmons smashes it well over the mid-wicket fence. Another huge over.", "Summary": {"Score": "123/0", "Over": "10", "Runs": "20", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3861", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "85", "Balls": "39", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "9"}, {"Batsman": "59314", "Runs": "36", "Balls": "21", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "2"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "63157", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "35", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:17:42+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.5", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,206,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63157", "Bowler_Name": "Barry McCarthy", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "FOUR! Now a boundary! Over the off side. It is full and outside off, Simmons lofts it over covers and bags a boundary.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:16:31+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "7,279,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63157", "Bowler_Name": "Barry McCarthy", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "SIX! Another biggie! Full and right in the zone for Simmons. He easily lifts it well over the long on fence. 8 sixes for him now.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:15:39+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63157", "Bowler_Name": "Barry McCarthy", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "Very full but very wide outside off. Wided.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:14:57+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63157", "Bowler_Name": "Barry McCarthy", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "The ball has taken the inside edge of the bat and goes down the leg side.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:14:25+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.2", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "8,331,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63157", "Bowler_Name": "Barry McCarthy", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "A full toss around off, Simmons drags it towards mid-wicket. It is in the gap so two taken.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:13:20+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.1", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,191,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63157", "Bowler_Name": "Barry McCarthy", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "A full ball on off, Lewis happy to stroke it gently to covers and turn the strike over.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:11:40+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "59", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,326,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "65690", "Bowler_Name": "Mark Adair", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "SIX! Just the 36 more needed now. One more short ball, this time Simmons gets hold of it as he hits it well over the long on fence.", "Summary": {"Score": "103/0", "Over": "9", "Runs": "14", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3861", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "67", "Balls": "34", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "7"}, {"Batsman": "59314", "Runs": "35", "Balls": "20", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "2"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "65690", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "22", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:10:32+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "58", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,210,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "65690", "Bowler_Name": "Mark Adair", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, it is hit hard through covers for one.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:09:50+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "57", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "6,255,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "65690", "Bowler_Name": "Mark Adair", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "The batsman has just lofted it over mid off. They pick up a single.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:08:46+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "56", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,342,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "65690", "Bowler_Name": "Mark Adair", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "SIX! Dealing in sixes is Simmons! A short ball on middle, LS pulls it over the mid-wicket fence for a biggie.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:08:03+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.2", "Id": "55", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "65690", "Bowler_Name": "Mark Adair", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "A yorker now on middle, LS jams it out back towards the bowler.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:07:27+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.1", "Id": "54", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "65690", "Bowler_Name": "Mark Adair", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "Simmons comes down the track but Adair bowls a short slower ball. LS smashes it back to the bowler.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:07:06+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.6", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "6,255,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66081", "Bowler_Name": "Joshua Little", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "FOUR! Shorter in length and outside off, this is hammered through extra cover and it races away to the fence. 50 more needed.", "Summary": {"Score": "89/0", "Over": "8", "Runs": "19", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59314", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "34", "Balls": "19", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "2"}, {"Batsman": "3861", "Runs": "54", "Balls": "29", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "5"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "66081", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "25", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:05:58+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.5", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66081", "Bowler_Name": "Joshua Little", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "Shorter and outside off, Lewis goes after it with not much foot movement, he gets beaten.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:05:13+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.5", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66081", "Bowler_Name": "Joshua Little", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "A bumper but way too short! Wided.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:04:48+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.4", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,329,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66081", "Bowler_Name": "Joshua Little", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "Fuller and on the pads, this is worked down to long on for one.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:03:58+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.3", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,339,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66081", "Bowler_Name": "Joshua Little", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "SIX! Fifty for Simmons! He gets there in style! A short ball on middle, Simmons pulls it over the mid-wicket fence for a biggie. He was given a chance and he made use of it. He would love to be there till the end now.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:03:12+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.2", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "6,267,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66081", "Bowler_Name": "Joshua Little", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "The batsman has driven it straight down the ground. They pick up a single.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:02:05+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "6,256,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66081", "Bowler_Name": "Joshua Little", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "SIX! Powered! A short ball, it is the slower one. Lewis waits for it and hammers it over the long off fence. Raining boundaries here. The Windies are in a hurry to end this game.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T01:00:47+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "67320", "Bowler_Name": "Simi Singh", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "A dipping low full toss, it is hit back to the bowler.", "Summary": {"Score": "70/0", "Over": "7", "Runs": "13", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3861", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "47", "Balls": "27", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "4"}, {"Batsman": "59314", "Runs": "23", "Balls": "15", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "67320", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "24", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T00:59:18+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.5", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "4,164,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "67320", "Bowler_Name": "Simi Singh", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "Shorter outside off, this is cut through covers for one.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T00:59:00+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.4", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,322,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "67320", "Bowler_Name": "Simi Singh", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "The batsman has picked it early and slogged it through the leg side. They pick up a single.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T00:58:33+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,336,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "67320", "Bowler_Name": "Simi Singh", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "SIX! All the way! Simmons makes room and Singh fires it on the leg pole. Simmons heaves it over the mid-wicket fence for one more maximum.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T00:58:11+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,203,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "67320", "Bowler_Name": "Simi Singh", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "Shorter and around off, this is pushed through covers for one.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T00:57:36+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.1", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "2,51,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "67320", "Bowler_Name": "Simi Singh", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "FOUR! Nicely played! Very full and on the pads, Lewis sweeps it nice and fine on the leg side and bags a boundary.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T00:57:12+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Commentary": "Simi Singh is on now!", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T00:55:58+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.6", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59442", "Bowler_Name": "Craig Young", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "Well fielded! Shorter and outside off, it is guided towards point where Stirling dives to his left and stops it. Saves three for his side. End of the Powerplay. West Indies are 57 for 0 after it. Another 82 needed.", "Summary": {"Score": "57/0", "Over": "6", "Runs": "16", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3861", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "40", "Balls": "24", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "3"}, {"Batsman": "59314", "Runs": "17", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "59442", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "16", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T00:55:21+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.5", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59442", "Bowler_Name": "Craig Young", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "A good short one outside off, Simmons looks to pull but misses.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T00:54:43+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.4", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "3,102,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59442", "Bowler_Name": "Craig Young", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "EDGY FOUR! Short and outside off, Simmons cuts but it flies off the outside edge and down to the third man fence.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T00:53:47+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.3", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59442", "Bowler_Name": "Craig Young", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "The batsman plays a pull shot to this short delivery.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T00:53:16+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.2", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "5,199,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59442", "Bowler_Name": "Craig Young", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "SIX! That dropped catch is costing a lot, consecutive maximums! This time over the off side. short and outside off, Simmons slaps it over covers for a biggie.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T00:52:46+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.1", "Id": "34", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "7,279,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59442", "Bowler_Name": "Craig Young", "Batsman": "3861", "Batsman_Name": "Lendl Simmons", "Commentary": "SIX! That is a huge hit! Length and on middle, Simmons tonks it over the long on fence.", "Timestamp": "2020-01-20T00:52:16+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.6", "Id": "33", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "7,276,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "65690", "Bowler_Name": "Mark Adair", "Batsman": "59314", "Batsman_Name": "Evin Lewis", "Commentary": "FOUR! Safe again! A short ball around off, Lewis looks to pull but gets a top edge. It goes over mid on. Balbirine hares after it. It lands ahead of him. He 